    "image_with_text_jFC67D": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_mckbY9": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Burn Performance and Setup",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_BTipNh": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Long-burning candles need a stable, calm setting to perform well. Place the candle on a flat, heat-safe surface away from airflow, open windows, fans, and vents, as they can cause uneven burning. A ceramic tile, metal tray, or purpose-made candle board under the glass provides an extra layer of protection for the surface underneath.</p><p>Yahrzeit memorial candles in glass are self-contained, but the glass does get warm during an extended burn. Keep the area around the candle clear and make sure nothing flammable is close by. For a 24-hour candle, the setup doesn't need to be complicated. A steady surface, calm placement, and a spot where the candle won't be knocked are enough.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "subheading_cRnYJD": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Bulk Yahrzeit Candles Ordering and Wholesale",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_i6tgzQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_VNDhrP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Synagogues and Jewish community centers often stock Yahrzeit candles throughout the year for congregants who observe multiple anniversaries, for communal Yahrzeit observances, and for distribution ahead of high-holiday seasons. Bulk pricing is available for ongoing purchasing. Contact us with your quantity needs and observance calendar to discuss a restocking plan that works for your organization.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
